      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "その前日まで、ゲシュペンス島では珍しいほどの嵐に、\n島中が襲われていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
